{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34466","headline":"和袭美褚家林亭 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美褚家林亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一阵西风起浪花，绕栏杆下散瑶华。\n高窗曲槛仙侯府，卧苇荒芹白鸟家。\n孤岛待寒凝片月，远山终日送余霞。\n若知方外还如此，不要秋乘上海槎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}